{"item_uid": "學測97-math-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "對任意實數x而言，27 3 的最小值為\n(1) 3 (2) 3 3 (3) 9 (4) 27 (5) 81 3", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "3", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 15.0, "2": 14.0, "3": 60.0, "4": 6.0, "5": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 4.0, "2": 2.0, "3": 92.0, "4": 1.0, "5": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 24.0, "2": 30.0, "3": 26.0, "4": 10.0, "5": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 60.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 26.0, "discrimination": 66.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 84.0, 63.0, 39.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測97-math-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在職棒比賽中ERA值是了解一個投手表現的重要統計數值。其計算方式如下：若此投手共主\nE\n投n局，其總責任失分為E，則其ERA值為 ×9。有一位投手在之前的比賽中共主投了90\nn\n局，且這90局中他的ERA 值為3.2。在最新的一場比賽中此投手主投6局無責任失分，則打\n完這一場比賽後，此投手的ERA值成為\n(1) 2.9 (2) 3.0 (3) 3.1 (4) 3.2 (5) 3.3", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "2", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 4.0, "2": 75.0, "3": 6.0, "4": 10.0, "5": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 1.0, "2": 96.0, "3": 1.0, "4": 1.0, "5": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 9.0, "2": 44.0, "3": 16.0, "4": 22.0, "5": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 44.0, "discrimination": 52.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 93.0, 86.0, 70.0, 30.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測97-math-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "有一個圓形跑道分內、外兩圈，半徑分別為30、50公尺。今甲在內圈以等速行走、乙在外圈\n以等速跑步，且知甲每走一圈，乙恰跑了兩圈。若甲走了45公尺，則同時段乙跑了\n(1) 90公尺 (2) 120公尺 (3)135公尺 (4)150公尺 (5) 180公尺", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "4", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 10.0, "2": 5.0, "3": 9.0, "4": 73.0, "5": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 1.0, "2": 0.0, "3": 1.0, "4": 97.0, "5": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 23.0, "2": 12.0, "3": 22.0, "4": 38.0, "5": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 73.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 38.0, "discrimination": 59.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 94.0, 86.0, 64.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測97-math-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某地區的車牌號碼共六碼，其中前兩碼為O以外的英文大寫字母，後四碼為0到9的阿拉伯數\n字，但規定不能連續出現三個4。例如：AA1234,AB4434為可出現的車牌號碼；而AO1234,\nAB3444為不可出現的車牌號碼。則所有第一碼為A且最後一碼為4的車牌號碼個數為\n(1)25×93 (2)25×92×10 (3)25×900 (4)25×990 (5)25×999\n-1-\n97年學測 第2頁\n數學考科 共7頁", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "4", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 5.0, "2": 19.0, "3": 30.0, "4": 39.0, "5": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 1.0, "2": 7.0, "3": 18.0, "4": 69.0, "5": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 10.0, "2": 31.0, "3": 33.0, "4": 17.0, "5": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 39.0, "p_high": 69.0, "p_low": 17.0, "discrimination": 52.0, "p_quintiles": [79.0, 48.0, 29.0, 23.0, 13.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測97-math-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "廣場上插了一支紅旗與一支白旗，小明站在兩支旗子之間。利用手邊的儀器，小明測出他與正\n東方紅旗間的距離為他與正西方白旗間距離的6倍；小明往正北方走了10公尺之後再測量一\n次，發現他與紅旗的距離變成他與白旗距離的4倍。試問紅白兩旗之間的距離最接近下列哪個\n選項？\n(1) 60公尺 (2) 65公尺 (3) 70公尺 (4) 75公尺 (5) 80公尺\n貳 、 多 選 題 （ 佔 35 分 ）\n說明：第6至12題，每題的五個選項各自獨立，其中至少有一個選項是正確的，選出正確選\n項劃記在答案卡之「解答欄」。每題皆不倒扣，五個選項全部答對者得5分，只錯一個\n選項可得2.5分，錯兩個或兩個以上選項不給分。", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "1", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 41.0, "2": 13.0, "3": 27.0, "4": 12.0, "5": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 74.0, "2": 6.0, "3": 11.0, "4": 4.0, "5": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 17.0, "2": 18.0, "3": 38.0, "4": 17.0, "5": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 41.0, "p_high": 74.0, "p_low": 17.0, "discrimination": 57.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 54.0, 30.0, 21.0, 15.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測97-math-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "試問：在坐標平面上，下列哪些選項中的函數圖形完全落在x軸的上方？\n(1) y=x+100\n(2) y=x2 +1\n(3) y=2+sinx\n(4) y = 2x\n(5) y=logx", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "234", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 17.0, "2": 84.0, "3": 72.0, "4": 82.0, "5": 27.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 1.0, "2": 98.0, "3": 94.0, "4": 99.0, "5": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 39.0, "2": 66.0, "3": 52.0, "4": 59.0, "5": 47.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 56.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 18.0, "discrimination": 74.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 83.0, 59.0, 31.0, 13.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測97-math-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某高中共有20個班級，每班各有40位學生，其中男生25人，女生15人。若從全校800人中\n以簡單隨機抽樣抽出80人，試問下列哪些選項是正確的？\n(1) 每班至少會有一人被抽中\n(2) 抽出來的男生人數一定比女生人數多\n(3) 已知小文是男生，小美是女生，則小文被抽中的機率大於小美被抽中的機率\n(4) 若學生甲和學生乙在同一班，學生丙在另外一班，則甲、乙兩人同時被抽中的機率跟甲、 丙\n兩人同時被抽中的機率一樣\n1\n(5) 學生A和學生B是兄弟，他們同時被抽中的機率小於\n100\n- 2 -\n第3頁 97年學測\n共7頁 數學考科", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "45", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 23.0, "2": 27.0, "3": 42.0, "4": 84.0, "5": 53.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 9.0, "2": 9.0, "3": 28.0, "4": 94.0, "5": 64.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 38.0, "2": 47.0, "3": 55.0, "4": 71.0, "5": 38.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 39.0, "p_high": 60.0, "p_low": 17.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [65.0, 50.0, 39.0, 27.0, 12.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測97-math-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "已知a ,a ,a 為一等差數列，而b,b ,b 為一等比數列，且此六數皆為實數。試問下列哪些選項\n1 2 3 1 2 3\n是正確的？\n(1) a < a 與a > a 可能同時成立\n1 2 2 3\n(2) b <b 與b >b 可能同時成立\n1 2 2 3\n(3) 若a +a <0，則a +a <0\n1 2 2 3\n(4) 若bb < 0，則b b <0\n1 2 2 3\n(5) 若b ,b ,b 皆為正整數且b <b ，則b 整除b\n1 2 3 1 2 1 2", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "24", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 13.0, "2": 74.0, "3": 25.0, "4": 79.0, "5": 71.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 3.0, "2": 92.0, "3": 5.0, "4": 97.0, "5": 69.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 27.0, "2": 51.0, "3": 51.0, "4": 56.0, "5": 65.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 36.0, "p_high": 57.0, "p_low": 15.0, "discrimination": 42.0, "p_quintiles": [62.0, 48.0, 37.0, 23.0, 11.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測97-math-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "已知在一容器中有A,B 兩種菌，且在任何時刻A,B兩種菌的個數乘積為定值1010。為了簡單起\n見，科學家用P =log(n )來記錄A菌個數的資料，其中n 為A菌的個數。試問下列哪些選項\nA A A\n是正確的？\n(1) 1≤P ≤10\nA\n(2) 當P =5時，B菌的個數與A菌的個數相同\nA\n(3) 如果上週一測得P 值為4而上週五測得P 值為8，表示上週五A菌的個數是上週一A菌\nA A\n個數的2倍\n(4) 若今天的P 值比昨天增加1，則今天的A菌比昨天多了10個\nA\n(5) 假設科學家將B菌的個數控制為5萬個，則此時5<P <5.5\nA", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "25", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 55.0, "2": 75.0, "3": 30.0, "4": 31.0, "5": 62.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 39.0, "2": 96.0, "3": 5.0, "4": 10.0, "5": 81.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 56.0, "2": 53.0, "3": 56.0, "4": 50.0, "5": 46.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 33.0, "p_high": 65.0, "p_low": 10.0, "discrimination": 55.0, "p_quintiles": [75.0, 45.0, 23.0, 13.0, 8.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測97-math-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "已知實係數多項式 f(x)與g(x)=x3 +x2 −2有次數大於0的公因式。試問下列哪些選項是正確\n的？\n(1) g(x)=0恰有一實根\n(2) f(x)=0必有實根\n(3) 若 f(x)=0與g(x)=0有共同實根，則此實根必為1\n(4) 若 f(x)=0與g(x)=0有共同實根，則 f(x)與g(x)的最高公因式為一次式\n(5) 若 f(x)=0與g(x)=0沒有共同實根，則 f(x)與g(x)的最高公因式為二次式\n-3-\n97年學測 第4頁\n數學考科 共7頁", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "135", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 72.0, "2": 48.0, "3": 71.0, "4": 58.0, "5": 58.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 91.0, "2": 27.0, "3": 90.0, "4": 52.0, "5": 83.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 54.0, "2": 58.0, "3": 56.0, "4": 57.0, "5": 39.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 26.0, "p_high": 52.0, "p_low": 10.0, "discrimination": 42.0, "p_quintiles": [64.0, 30.0, 16.0, 12.0, 8.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
